{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38904","headline":"中山临上人院观牡丹寄诸从事 · 杜荀鹤","name":"中山临上人院观牡丹寄诸从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲来吟遶牡丹丛，花艳人生事畧同。\n半雨半风三月内，多愁多病百年中。\n开当韶景何妨好，落向僧家即是空。\n一境别无唯此有，忍教醒坐对支公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}